Hi Josh,
That's weird. I just tried your code and had no problem. It seems it downloaded the DEM and the SILO data, then got past the internal call to micro_global (which it uses to work out cloud cover from the SILO solar radiation), and then failed to do the final bit - it should then output this message:

"running microclimate model for 731 days from 01/01/2016 to 31/12/2017 at site long 135 lat -27.5"
All I can suggest is that you restart your system and try again, or try on a different system.

All the best,
Mike

